      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah exactly. i was thinking the same thing. if it's modulated light, does that mean it doesn't even need a microphone? like is it just picking up the vibrations in the air and converting them into those light patterns? it's terrifying to think they could be doing this without any actual \"recording\" software being detected on the network.",
